OL,4,CGrand Theft Auto 6 is a masterpiece,   
OL,5,Csay critics                            
OL,6,GAfter 13 years of waiting, record-     
OL,7,Gbreaking trailers and lengthy delays,  
OL,8,Gcritics have given their answer to one 
OL,9,Gof the year's biggest questions.       
OL,11,FDoes Grand Theft Auto 6, surely the    
OL,12,Fmost anticipated game of all time,     
OL,13,Flive up to the hype?                   
OL,15,FAccording to the first reviews, it's a 
OL,16,Fresounding yes.                        
OL,18,FMetacritic, which aggregates reviews   
OL,19,Ffrom critics, averages it at 99 out of 
OL,20,F100 - tying with Nintendo's The Legend 
OL,21,Fof Zelda: Ocarina of Time, which has   
OL,22,Fheld the record since 1998.       G3/7 
