OL,4,CBritish hacker who stole $11m through  
OL,5,Ctext message scheme jailed for six     
OL,6,Cyears in US                            
OL,7,GA British hacker has been sentenced to 
OL,8,Gsix years in a federal prison in the   
OL,9,GUS for conspiring to hack into at      
OL,10,Gleast a dozen companies via text       
OL,11,Gmessage phishing, and stealing more    
OL,12,Gthan $11.6m (#8.8m) in cryptocurrency  
OL,13,Gfrom individual victims.               
OL,15,FTyler Buchanan, 24, from Dundee,       
OL,16,Fstarted hacking as a teenager and was  
OL,17,Fpart of the collective of young        
OL,18,Fhackers known as Scattered Spider,     
OL,19,Fwhich has been blamed for a string of  
OL,20,Fhigh profile cyber-crimes.             
OL,22,                                   G4/7 
