OL,4,CWaymo pulls driverless taxis from all  
OL,5,CUS freeways                            
OL,6,GWaymo has temporarily suspended its    
OL,7,Gdriverless vehicles from operating on  
OL,8,Gall US freeways, the company has said. 
OL,10,FThe decision comes after California    
OL,11,Fbanned Waymo's driverless taxis from   
OL,12,Fstate freeways following a series of   
OL,13,Frecent traffic incidents.              
OL,15,FCalifornia's Department of Motor       
OL,16,FVehicles (DMV) cited an "imminent      
OL,17,Fhazard to public safety" for the ban,  
OL,18,Fnoting an incident this month in which 
OL,19,Fseveral driverless Waymo vehicles      
OL,20,Fentered an active construction zone on 
OL,21,FUS Route 101.                          
OL,22,                                   G6/7 
